{"title":"Audit logging","description":"Record who ran which tool on which files, choose how much to log and how long to keep it, and review the log in Settings.","unlisted":false,"space":"server","layout":"","article":"<a class=\"doc-space\" data-accent=\"server\" href=\"/Server/\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 6.5h.01M7 17.5h.01\"/></svg><span>Self-hosted server</span></a>\n    <h1>Audit logging</h1>\n<p>Record every operation on your server: who ran it, which tool, which files and when. The full audit log needs an Enterprise licence.</p>\n<p>Records are stored in the server's database. At high volume, use an <a href=\"/Server/Storage/Database/\">external database</a>.</p>\n<p>Without Enterprise, the server still records document processing for the Processor's <a href=\"/Processor/Documents/\">Documents</a> page and keeps those records for at most 30 days. Turning audit logging off also stops these records.</p>\n<h2 id=\"turn-it-on\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Turn it on<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#turn-it-on\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>Change the settings in <strong>Settings → Server → Sign-in &amp; security → Audit Logging</strong>, or under <code>premium.enterpriseFeatures.audit</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"tabs\" data-group=\"config-methods\" data-sync=\"true\" id=\"tabs-0\"><div class=\"tab-list\" role=\"tablist\"><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-value=\"settings\" aria-selected=\"true\">Settings File</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"env\" aria-selected=\"false\">Environment Variable</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel active\" data-value=\"settings\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">premium</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  enterpriseFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    audit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      retentionDays</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      captureFileHash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      capturePdfAuthor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      captureOperationResults</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"env\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PREMIUM_ENTERPRISEFEATURES_AUDIT_ENABLED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PREMIUM_ENTERPRISEFEATURES_AUDIT_LEVEL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PREMIUM_ENTERPRISEFEATURES_AUDIT_RETENTIONDAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">90</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PREMIUM_ENTERPRISEFEATURES_AUDIT_CAPTUREFILEHASH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PREMIUM_ENTERPRISEFEATURES_AUDIT_CAPTUREPDFAUTHOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PREMIUM_ENTERPRISEFEATURES_AUDIT_CAPTUREOPERATIONRESULTS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">false</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div></div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Setting</th>\n<th>In the app</th>\n<th>Default</th>\n<th>What it does</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>enabled</code></td>\n<td><strong>Enable Audit Logging</strong></td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n<td>Turn audit logging on or off.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>level</code></td>\n<td><strong>Audit Level</strong></td>\n<td><code>2</code></td>\n<td>How much to record (see below).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>retentionDays</code></td>\n<td><strong>Audit Retention (days)</strong></td>\n<td><code>90</code></td>\n<td>Days to keep records. <code>0</code> or less keeps them forever.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>captureFileHash</code></td>\n<td><strong>Capture File Hash (SHA-256)</strong></td>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n<td>Store a SHA-256 hash of each file. Adds 50-200 ms per file.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>capturePdfAuthor</code></td>\n<td><strong>Capture PDF Author Metadata</strong></td>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n<td>Store the author field from each PDF. Slows processing.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>captureOperationResults</code></td>\n<td><strong>Capture Operation Results</strong></td>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n<td>Store what each operation returned. Greatly increases log size, so use it only for debugging.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"audit-levels\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Audit levels<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#audit-levels\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Level</th>\n<th>What's recorded</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>0</code> OFF</td>\n<td>Nothing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>1</code> BASIC</td>\n<td>PDF operations (compress, split, merge and so on) and settings changes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>2</code> STANDARD</td>\n<td>BASIC plus user actions such as sign-in, sign-out and account changes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>3</code> VERBOSE</td>\n<td>Everything, including background polling requests</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"review-the-log\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Review the log<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#review-the-log\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>Open <strong>Settings → Monitoring → Audit log</strong>. The <strong>Dashboard</strong>, <strong>Audit Events</strong>, <strong>Export</strong> and <strong>Clear Data</strong> tabs let you chart activity, search and filter events, export them as CSV or JSON, and permanently delete all audit data.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Server/Security/Audit-Logging.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"<div class=\"toc-title\">On this page</div><ul><li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#turn-it-on\">Turn it on</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#audit-levels\">Audit levels</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#review-the-log\">Review the log</a></li></ul>","pager":"<a class=\"pager-link pager-prev\" href=\"/Server/Security/Signing/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">&larr; Previous</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Signing &amp; certificates</span>\n      </a><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/Server/Security/Fail2Ban/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Fail2Ban</span>\n      </a>"}